WEBVTT

00:05:56.676 --> 00:06:00.316
accounting for 17 percent of the total.

00:06:01.316 --> 00:06:07.596
This is a measure that has been planned
in the climate budget since 2017,

00:06:07.636 --> 00:06:13.236
and it will be the department of business
development and public ownership,

00:06:13.236 --> 00:06:18.396
with its specific skills, that will have
the responsibility for implementing it.

00:06:18.396 --> 00:06:22.796
And the carbon will be captured
from 2026 and onwards.

00:06:23.356 --> 00:06:26.676
That's the third lesson learned.

00:06:26.716 --> 00:06:33.036
A comprehensive government system
is key to distribute responsibility